"vector_similarity\": 0.7269852, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Review-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9a8a8848a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Review-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Review-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1278, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:48\", \"token_count\": 583, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-46\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-46\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-46\\n\\n**Title**: Correct high-DPI PDF coordinate scaling\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-15\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nFix coordinate misalignment defects reported on high-DPI displays. The scaling-math error was traced to a bug in the upstream rendering library, and the task is blocked with no local fix available yet.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-46\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-46\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-46\\n\\n**Title**: Correct high-DPI PDF coordinate scaling\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-15\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Coordinate alignment on high-DPI displays matches the preview overlay coordinates.\\n\\n- Root cause of the scaling-math error is fixed (currently blocked on an upstream library bug).\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-46\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-46\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-46\\n\\n**Title**: Correct high-DPI PDF coordinate scaling\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-15\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nFix coordinate misalignment defects reported on high-DPI displays. The scaling-math error was traced to a bug in the upstream rendering library, and the task is blocked with no local fix available yet.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-46\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-46\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-46\\n\\n**Title**: Correct high-DPI PDF coordinate scaling\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-15\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-15**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Opened the task because high-DPI PDF coordinate alignment defects were reported.*\\n\\n- **2026-09-10**: Diana - Upstream Scaling Bug Block (Blocked)\\n\\n - *Blocked after tracing the scaling-math error to a bug in the upstream rendering library, with no local fix yet.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 46 sourc id src cu ciph 46 task id ciph 46 titl correct high dpi pdf coordin scale status block assigne charli prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 15 descript fix coordin misalign defect report on high dpi display the scale math error wa trace to a bug in the upstream render librari and the task is block with no local fix avail yet clickup task ciph 46 sourc id src cu ciph 46 task id ciph 46 titl correct high dpi pdf coordin scale status block assigne charli prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 15 accept criterion coordin align on high dpi display match the preview overlay coordin root caus of the scale math error is fix current block on an upstream librari bug clickup task ciph 46 sourc id src cu ciph 46 task id ciph 46 titl correct high dpi pdf coordin scale status block assigne charli prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 15 descript fix coordin misalign defect report on high dpi display the scale math error wa trace to a bug in the upstream render librari and the task is block with no local fix avail yet clickup task ciph 46 sourc id src cu ciph 46 task id ciph 46 titl correct high dpi pdf coordin scale status block assigne charli prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 15 activ histori 2026 08 15 alic task creat open open the task becaus high dpi pdf coordin align defect were report 2026 09 10 diana upstream scale bug block block block after trace the scale math error to a bug in the upstream render librari with no local fix yet\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e976998e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-46-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes.md\", \"id\": \"5198c4b9e704eb68\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.333453847965831, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.16259041137975863, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7321352, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-46-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e976998e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-46-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-46-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 974, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:27\", \"token_count\": 505, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-41\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Title**: Stream-chunk multi-GB PDF loads without retaining buffers\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-12\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAdd stream chunking so large, multi-GB PDF documents can be processed without excessive memory pressure. Chunking was merged, but the task was reopened after files over 2GB were found to still leak memory; buffer-release logic is being refactored to release buffers after each chunk.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-41\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Title**: Stream-chunk multi-GB PDF loads without retaining buffers\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-12\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Large PDF documents are processed via stream chunking rather than loading whole files into memory.\\n\\n- Memory buffers are released after each chunk, with no leak on files 2GB and larger.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-41\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Title**: Stream-chunk multi-GB PDF loads without retaining buffers\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-12\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAdd stream chunking so large, multi-GB PDF documents can be processed without excessive memory pressure. Chunking was merged, but the task was reopened after files over 2GB were found to still leak memory; buffer-release logic is being refactored to release buffers after each chunk.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-41\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Title**: Stream-chunk multi-GB PDF loads without retaining buffers\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-12\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-12**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Opened the task because large-file chunking is needed for multi-GB documents.*\\n\\n- **2026-08-20**: Charlie - Buffer Release Refactor (Active (Reopened))\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 41 sourc id src cu ciph 41 task id ciph 41 titl stream chunk multi gb pdf load without retain buffer status activ reopen assigne charli prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 12 descript add stream chunk so larg multi gb pdf document can be process without excess memori pressur chunk wa merg but the task wa reopen after file over 2gb were found to still leak memori buffer releas logic is be refactor to releas buffer after each chunk clickup task ciph 41 sourc id src cu ciph 41 task id ciph 41 titl stream chunk multi gb pdf load without retain buffer status activ reopen assigne charli prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 12 accept criterion larg pdf document are process via stream chunk rather than load whole file into memori memori buffer are releas after each chunk with no leak on file 2gb and larger clickup task ciph 41 sourc id src cu ciph 41 task id ciph 41 titl stream chunk multi gb pdf load without retain buffer status activ reopen assigne charli prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 12 descript add stream chunk so larg multi gb pdf document can be process without excess memori pressur chunk wa merg but the task wa reopen after file over 2gb were found to still leak memori buffer releas logic is be refactor to releas buffer after each chunk clickup task ciph 41 sourc id src cu ciph 41 task id ciph 41 titl stream chunk multi gb pdf load without retain buffer status activ reopen assigne charli prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 12 activ histori 2026 08 12 alic task creat open open the task becaus larg file chunk is need for multi gb document 2026 08 20 charli buffer releas refactor activ reopen\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e96b7f688a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-41-Large-File-Chunking.md\", \"id\": \"7fab92c2892cd73f\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.330897487965831, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.16259041137975863, \"vector_similarity\": 0.723614, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-41-Large-File-Chunking.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e96b7f688a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-41-Large-File-Chunking.md\", \"lo